flowchart TD
    A([Administrator creates Company])
    --> B[Enter Company information]

    B --> C{Use Default Company<br/>configuration?}

    C -->|No| D[Create empty Company configuration]

    C -->|Yes| E[Select configuration categories]

    E --> F[Copy selected configuration<br/>from Default Company]

    F --> G[Copied data becomes<br/>independent Company data]

    D --> H[Company created as PENDING]
    G --> H

    H --> I[Review setup progress]

    I --> J[Complete remaining setup steps]

    J --> K{All mandatory steps complete?}

    K -->|No| I

    K -->|Yes| L[Administrator activates Company]

    L --> M([Company ACTIVE])